                                "sense_id": "8c7dbbbd-d83b-3baa-aa96-047eb6cd74e8",
                                "text": "As said, these investigations generally do not pay attention to saw kerf width and green size of sawn timber. These studies have mainly been made by practical test sawings and subsequently checked by geometric calculations."
